                <mxCell id="zPBDHpfH6a97GSw9BV1H-42" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;镜像启动顺序：Maskrom -&amp;gt; TPL(ddr bin) -&amp;gt; SPL(miniloader) -&amp;gt; Trust(ATF + OP-TEE) -&amp;gt; u-boot -&amp;gt; kernel -&amp;gt; rootfs&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
